I arrive at the office.
I go inside.
Rohan is at his desk.
He is working on the computer.
I say to him, "Good morning, Rohan."
Rohan smiles and says, "Good morning, Maya."
"How are you?" he asks.
"I am fine, thank you," I reply.
I go to my desk.
I put my bag down.
I sit on my chair.
I turn on my computer.
The computer is starting.
I put my water bottle on the desk.
I open my email.
I am reading my new emails.
I am replying to a colleague.
I am typing my message.
It is quiet in the office.
My work is starting.
